 {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Rao-Scott chi-square tests of independence were used to assess whether HDP prevalence differed by characteristics.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Percentage of deaths during delivery hospitalization with a documented HDP diagnosis code were calculated.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS survey procedures and weighting were used to account for complex sampling in the National Inpatient Sample.\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}